ection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:a8becc45-61b3-4a3f-bb86-8b94fc8f87ba" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="ddbb2c57-0c1f-4320-ae57-19c0b7cc92ea"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_10f_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="ddbb2c57-0c1f-4320-ae57-19c0b7cc92ea" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="0" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="ddbb2c57-0c1f-4320-ae57-19c0b7cc92ea"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text">Vou adaptar a solução ao teu <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">index.html</code> e ao <code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code">style.css</code>, mantendo o formulário funcional e garantindo que o texto continua legível sobre a imagem.</p></div></div></div><div class="contents"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div hidden=""><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_10i_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" data-markdown-text-tone="tertiary" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Preparadas e aplicadas alterações no fundo</span></p></div></div><div hidden=""><div class="min-w-0 text-size-chat relative overflow-visible py-0"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col"><div class="group/activity-header relative inline-flex min-w-0 max-w-full self-start items-center gap-1 p-0 text-start max-w-full"><span class="inline-flex min-w-0 gap-2 group-data-[spacing=grouped]/agent-activity:align-top items-center shrink truncate text-size-chat"><span class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-0.5"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="Icon-X4VkKC" focusable="false" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/cdn/assets/icons-7facfe40590b2f9e.svg#codex-icon-terminal-light-16" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate [&amp;_*:not(button)]:!text-(--agent-activity-summary-color) summary-fnAD_7"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_10o_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" data-markdown-text-tone="tertiary" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><p class="Paragraph-kKnbIo" dir="auto"><span>Preparados ficheiros ZIP RentGo com imagens de fundo hero</span></p></div></span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="block-BQZwFn"><div data-content-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-0:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-unit-key="fallback-turn-0:2:assistant" data-chatgpt-search-message-ids="8a907258-1d16-4587-bca5-8f4f6ef0ab09 8a907258-1d16-4587-bca5-8f4f6ef0ab09"><h4 class="sr-only m-0 select-none print:not-sr-only print:mt-4 print:mb-2 print:text-xs print:leading-normal print:font-bold print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:mt-6 print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:font-normal print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:text-secondary" data-conversation-role="assistant" tabindex="-1"><span class="print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:sr-only">O ChatGPT disse:</span><span class="hidden print:group-data-[print-formatting]/conversation-print:inline" aria-hidden="true">ChatGPT</span></h4><div><div class="group flex min-w-0 flex-col" data-chatgpt-selection-conversation-id="local-chatgpt:a8becc45-61b3-4a3f-bb86-8b94fc8f87ba" data-chatgpt-selection-message-id="8a907258-1d16-4587-bca5-8f4f6ef0ab09"><div data-selected-text-overlay-target="_r_vd_" dir="auto" data-markdown-text-style="assistant-message" class="MarkdownRoot-rZKhxa [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;&gt;ol:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;ul:first-child]:mt-0" style="--markdown-link-color: currentColor;"><div class="my-4 first:mt-0 last:mb-0 empty:hidden" data-dil-source-message-id="8a907258-1d16-4587-bca5-8f4f6ef0ab09" data-chatgpt-copy-reference="2" data-markdown-copy="contents"><div class="[--entity-prose-inset:0px]"><div hidden=""></div><div class="relative PortalBoundary-TFj9W2 Renderer-ojZscX" data-theme="light" style="--puik-portal-zoom: 1;"><div dir="auto" class="DilRenderer-tB76Jj DilResponseRoot-HfQrEh Reveal-k2IWvM" data-dil-response="" data-d-direction="col" data-dil-message-id="8a907258-1d16-4587-bca5-8f4f6ef0ab09"><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">Sim! Já analisei o teu </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">index.html</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">, o </span><code class="Code-kbs71c" data-d-component="code"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">style.css</span></code><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);"> e as duas imagens. A boa notícia é que </span><span class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text" data-d-default-strong="" data-d-inline=""><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">não precisas de reconstruir a página</span></span><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">. A estrutura que já tens é adequada para conseguir o resultado que pretendes.</span></p><p class="TextBase-hXhSqg Text-lIMP0_" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="text"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">O que precisamos é de transformar a secção principal (onde estão o título e o formulário) numa secção com uma imagem de fundo.</span></p><h2 class="TextBase-hXhSqg Title-HRvkwB" data-d-text-flow="" data-d-component="title" data-d-size="lg" data-d-weight="semibold"><span data-d-stream-run="" data-d-text-flow="run" style="--d-stream-ink: rgb(13, 13, 13);">O resultado que vamos procurar</span></h2><div class="Box-qIMv6G" data-d-auto-spacing="" data-d-clip="true" data-d-component="box" data-d-direction="col" data-d-has-height="" data-d-image-frame="" style="--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background-color: var(--color-surface-tertiary); height: auto; max-width: 100%; min-width: 0px; width: 100%;"><div class="Image-eK79_D OverlayBox-vnB7gO LoadingFrame-p8B6Sc group/search-image" data-d-component="image" data-d-stream-media="" data-d-hover-zoom="" style="border-radius: var(--dil-radius-xl); aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; height: 100%; width: 100%; overflow: hidden;" data-d-frame=""><img alt="Amalfi Coast Car Rental — Naples Airport Deals &amp; SS163 Guide 2026" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" class="Image-LDLXtM Image-eK79_D LoadingImage-HroCZg" draggable="false" src="./hero-rent_files/ayxqkKPcc9dU_7HWDCMVchc8LahYP_2EYsRUzoTPVEgeub8wgVOZALdHzKUe6t_HKPBI-heha5p-7HE3_q8Ex-gNkxMOelijN7DLZMgZbSjNb